            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Selection sort</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">\u2022 Repeatedly scans the <em>unsorted</em> part of the array to find the minimum.\n\u2022 Swaps that minimum into the next position of the sorted prefix.\n\u2022 Always does the same number of comparisons (O(n\u00b2)).</span></span>"
          }
        }
